<title>CANADA: Canada's Prairies to see sunny, hot weahter.</title>
<headline>Canada's Prairies to see sunny, hot weahter.</headline>
<dateline>WINNIPEG 1997-08-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Canada's Prairies on Tuesday were forecast to see sunny, hot weather, Environment Canada said.</p>
<p>Alberta should see sunny skies and highs of 30 to 36 Celsius.</p>
<p>Saskatchewan should see sunny skies and highs of 30 to 36 Celsius.</p>
<p>Manitoba should see sunny skies and highs of 30 Celsius.</p>
<p>((Gilbert Le Gras, Winnipeg Reuters bureau 204 947 3548))</p>
